      en: ["Sjøgata is one of Norway's best-preserved wooden building districts.", "Fru Haugans Hotel was established in 1794.", "The Alcoa aluminum plant has been the main employer since 1958.", "The Helgelandstrappa stairs were constructed by Nepalese Sherpas.", "The Vefsna River was historically famous for its massive salmon.", "Mosjøen was officially granted trade town status in 1875."],
