      en: ["Flekkefjord was officially incorporated as a town in 1842.", "Hollenderbyen refers to the Dutch merchants who lived here in the 1600s.", "The Flekkefjord Line for rail biking features exactly 17 tunnels.", "The Flekkefjord Church is an octagonal structure built in 1833.", "The island of Hidra is accessible by ferry and is a historic fishing hub.", "The local museum is housed in a building dating back to 1724."],
