      hu: ["Harstad városát 1904-ben alapították", "A trondenes-i templom 1250 körül épült", "Az Adolf-ágyú kalibere 40,6 cm", "Harstad Hinnøyán, Norvégia legnagyobb szigetén fekszik", "1965 óta itt rendezik az Észak-norvégiai Ünnepi Játékokat", "A város kikötője központi logisztikai csomópont"],
      ro: ["Orașul Harstad a fost fondat în anul 1904", "Biserica din Trondenes datează din anul 1250", "Tunul Adolf are un calibru de 40,6 cm", "Harstad se află pe Hinnøya, cea mai mare insulă a Norvegiei", "Gazda Festivalului Norvegiei de Nord din 1965", "Portul este un nod logistic central în regiune"],
      en: ["Harstad was formally established in 1904", "Trondenes Church dates back to approximately 1250", "The Adolf Cannon features a massive 40.6 cm caliber", "Harstad is located on Hinnøya, Norway's largest island", "Host of the Festival of Northern Norway since 1965", "The harbor serves as a primary logistical hub"],
