      en: ["The name Lakselv translates to 'Salmon River' in English.", "Banak Airport serves as a major base for search and rescue helicopters.", "Porsanger is Norway's only officially trilingual municipality.", "The Lakselva River is consistently ranked among the best salmon rivers.", "The town was razed to the ground in 1944 during the German retreat.", "It is situated at the head of the 123-kilometer-long Porsanger Fjord."],
