      en: ["Mandal has been recognized as a trading town since 1779 and is located at Norway's southernmost point.", "The Sjøsanden beach extends over a length of approximately 800 meters.", "The Mandal Museum houses works by five world-class local artists.", "The Mandalselva was the second-best salmon river in Norway by catch weight in 2011.", "The Andorsengården building, dating from 1801, is one of the grandest in the town.", "The Skalldyrfestivalen takes place every year on the second weekend of August."],
