      en: ["The Kårstø terminal is one of the world's largest exporters of natural gas liquids (NGL).", "Aksdal is located at the strategic junction of the E39 and E134 highways.", "Painter Lars Hertervig was born in 1830 on the island of Borgøy in Tysvær.", "The municipality covers a total area of approximately 425 square kilometres.", "Tysvær was established as an independent municipality in 1849.", "There are over 1000 kilometres of coastline within the municipality boundaries."],
